<description>&lt;p&gt;Chinese bomber flights and a surveillance plane continue operating near the Philippine coast and in the West Philippine Sea, while the Philippine armed forces observed 48 Chinese Coast Guard and PLA Navy vessels across four disputed features, more than double the prior count. The Philippine Coast Guard commissioned three locally built survey ships, three new patrol vessels, and added five ships received from Japan, expanding its capabilities. French Navy ships conducted joint drills with the Philippine Coast Guard in the Sulu Sea, and a Chinese coast guard vessel fired a water cannon at a Philippine vessel. 176 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxQbUJVQ2JZcnNsSFBFOTVuU0tTUjZUOHpSNFhpMXFkOVIxR0NFSUJ5d0F4a3BVa1BRcXdIUldMZjFKd1lMV2c3VjYxRHZEWnpvOTY2UE92dXowSUh6U00xRHpVYm52Y3VYQklTaVNQWFJBdFVFNUxxSk9uX2R6X25qNjkzNE1LOUM1a011ZmpUd29sMHI2OTdyNmJrSVFScmNUTkl3WFhfc0h4N3ZHZkctRnlWNFRncUg1Wi13SHVDU0ZldkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxPZklpWjJYbHBmMFVaTjRJaEd4ZE1lMHMtcVJKMEVZdkNFOFhLY2JGN2V1Vjdod1lRZjlZYkZHSWlWOUlIZFRkR29wV1JIOEFYbTZ4YnRwWDhvYkFaMldMZEJqY0xXcW4xLUJIcnZOaUp6cG8tdk9kMUNVbHI0YTBkYmN3?oc=5&quot;&gt;USNI News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxPQ0Q2WVdBd0FDN2tHN0tzcUg1WkVSNnhvOGRORTVlZGJqY2U4RjQ5WjZqa29HN1lBSmZzRVdiNi0wQW5xVkxCQURDRFc2TndHVE5sNTlOcHB3WUhyc3AwRFN3M3lIQmVsenNvaGtDdDFOX1ZoN2dHVk9EbEtjWnhTdHpKSUVCRzdudmVwYzJ1cFlBTElUYzkwZ3VlemxJWW9PSlJIS0ozWW1TVXh6UnQtTy1ZaWlTSkx2dW5xTUlDVmc0MmlTTGc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Vietnam.vn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOQXVkTFVCX0JfaEg0cnpCcF82RzB0Tm10UWNBM05qN1R3SnNadDhpVnQ0eU5MMEdGS2ExaTBraDdUX3NaSU81amJPa1F5dWthZURXOW